        "How sensitive the content of this case is.": "How sensitive the content of this case is.",
        "How soon this case matters. The other half of the pair the case type's matrix reads. A case type may declare a default for a new case, and an intake channel that creates cases takes that default rather than inventing one.": "How soon this case matters. The other half of the pair the case type's matrix reads. A case type may declare a default for a new case, and an intake channel that creates cases takes that default rather than inventing one.",
