        "The action handler this act runs, from the same registry a task effect names.": "The action handler this act runs, from the same registry a task effect names.",
        "The action whose completion planned this one, empty for the first of a chain. It is what makes a chain readable backwards without a separate log.": "The action whose completion planned this one, empty for the first of a chain. It is what makes a chain readable backwards without a separate log.",
        "The actions above a case of this type, in order, by the id of the case page's header action. Empty keeps the page's own.": "The actions above a case of this type, in order, by the id of the case page's header action. Empty keeps the page's own.",
        "The acts a handler may take on a case of this type whatever phase it is in, beside the acts of the current phase. Both halves are offered together and the always-available ones are marked as such, so \"what may I do right now\" is one list with two halves rather than two places to look. An act named here does not appear in the phase strip, does not count towards the progress figure and is given no phase term.": "The acts a handler may take on a case of this type whatever phase it is in, beside the acts of the current phase. Both halves are offered together and the always-available ones are marked as such, so \"what may I do right now\" is one list with two halves rather than two places to look. An act named here does not appear in the phase strip, does not count towards the progress figure and is given no phase term.",
        "The acts of this case type that may not be performed while a walked approval is still open in decidiq. Each entry names the act, the decidiq decision type that answers it, and what to call the approval in the refusal. An act named here is refused with the approval named until decidiq reports it granted. An outcome dossiq cannot read leaves the act refused, never allowed: a case that proceeds because decidiq was briefly unreachable is the failure this declaration exists to prevent (ADR-102).": "The acts of this case type that may not be performed while a walked approval is still open in decidiq. Each entry names the act, the decidiq decision type that answers it, and what to call the approval in the refusal. An act named here is refused with the approval named until decidiq reports it granted. An outcome dossiq cannot read leaves the act refused, never allowed: a case that proceeds because decidiq was briefly unreachable is the failure this declaration exists to prevent (ADR-102).",
        "The adapter class named in %1$s cannot be used: %2$s is missing or does not implement the seam. A mock adapter is running in its place.": "The adapter class named in %1$s cannot be used: %2$s is missing or does not implement the seam. A mock adapter is running in its place.",
