        "The address of the Nextcloud Mail account this team's case mail leaves from, so a bezwaar goes out as Juridische Zaken. Leave it empty to use the account picked in the dossiq mail settings. A case type naming an address no Mail account holds cannot be published.": "The address of the Nextcloud Mail account this team's case mail leaves from, so a bezwaar goes out as Juridische Zaken. Leave it empty to use the account picked in the dossiq mail settings. A case type naming an address no Mail account holds cannot be published.",
