        "The answers this field accepts, one per entry. OpenRegister's `enum` constraint applies to every type, so a choice list is not a type of its own: a text field, a number field or a date field can each limit its answers to a list. Leave it empty and the field takes any answer its type allows. A field whose stored type is the old 'enum' keeps its values here.": "The answers this field accepts, one per entry. OpenRegister's `enum` constraint applies to every type, so a choice list is not a type of its own: a text field, a number field or a date field can each limit its answers to a list. Leave it empty and the field takes any answer its type allows. A field whose stored type is the old 'enum' keeps its values here.",
        "The answers to the case type's fields flagged sensitive, in the shape of `properties`. Readable and writable only by the group dossiq-sensitive.": "The answers to the case type's fields flagged sensitive, in the shape of `properties`. Readable and writable only by the group dossiq-sensitive.",
