        "The app that declares this case type, when another app does. Empty for a case type this organisation wrote itself. CaseTypeContributionRegistry stamps it from the app id rather than reading it from the provider: a provider naming a different app as the contributor would make an unowned case type look owned. SeedContributedCaseTypes writes a contributed case type ONCE and never again, so an administrator who edits it keeps their edit through every upgrade.": "The app that declares this case type, when another app does. Empty for a case type this organisation wrote itself. CaseTypeContributionRegistry stamps it from the app id rather than reading it from the provider: a provider naming a different app as the contributor would make an unowned case type look owned. SeedContributedCaseTypes writes a contributed case type ONCE and never again, so an administrator who edits it keeps their edit through every upgrade.",
