        "The condition that clears the marker. Clearing is doing the work, never opening the panel, so the only clearing a marker may declare is that the thing that raised it stopped being true.": "The condition that clears the marker. Clearing is doing the work, never opening the panel, so the only clearing a marker may declare is that the thing that raised it stopped being true.",
        "The condition that raises the marker. A closed list, and a short one on purpose: a condition nothing can evaluate is a marker that never appears and never says why. A marker for a document that failed its virus scan is absent because `scanVerdict` is the open scan-verdict-on-the-row change and no document carries one yet, and a marker for a party whose post came back is absent because a role carries no such field. Both land when the fields do. `aanvullingsverzoek-open` reads the derived flag `aanvullingsverzoek-as-a-record` writes and raises nothing until that change lands, which is declared rather than silent.": "The condition that raises the marker. A closed list, and a short one on purpose: a condition nothing can evaluate is a marker that never appears and never says why. A marker for a document that failed its virus scan is absent because `scanVerdict` is the open scan-verdict-on-the-row change and no document carries one yet, and a marker for a party whose post came back is absent because a role carries no such field. Both land when the fields do. `aanvullingsverzoek-open` reads the derived flag `aanvullingsverzoek-as-a-record` writes and raises nothing until that change lands, which is declared rather than silent.",
