        "The day the personal data in this case stops having a lawful purpose (AVG art. 5.1e). Counted from the case's end date and the case type's own retention, never from the archive action date. The two clocks disagree on purpose, and a case that carries one date answers whichever question it was built for and gets the other one wrong.": "The day the personal data in this case stops having a lawful purpose (AVG art. 5.1e). Counted from the case's end date and the case type's own retention, never from the archive action date. The two clocks disagree on purpose, and a case that carries one date answers whichever question it was built for and gets the other one wrong.",
