        "The generic phase this status belongs to (for example Ontvangst, Beoordeling, Advies, Besluit, Verzending). Process analysis groups statuses by it, so case types with different statuses read side by side; a status without one keeps its own name there.": "The generic phase this status belongs to (for example Ontvangst, Beoordeling, Advies, Besluit, Verzending). Process analysis groups statuses by it, so case types with different statuses read side by side; a status without one keeps its own name there.",
        "The generic phase this status belongs to (for example Ontvangst, Beoordeling, Advies, Besluit, Verzending, Uitvoering for carrying out a decision). Process analysis groups statuses by it, so case types with different statuses read side by side; a status without one keeps its own name there.": "The generic phase this status belongs to (for example Ontvangst, Beoordeling, Advies, Besluit, Verzending, Uitvoering for carrying out a decision). Process analysis groups statuses by it, so case types with different statuses read side by side; a status without one keeps its own name there.",
        "The generic role this case-type role plays, so routing rules and reports can speak about \"the handler\" without knowing every case type's own naming. Maps to the ZGW RolType field omschrijvingGeneriek. Set from the Roles tab in case-type settings, and shipped by the bezwaar and besluitvorming seed data.": "The generic role this case-type role plays, so routing rules and reports can speak about \"the handler\" without knowing every case type's own naming. Maps to the ZGW RolType field omschrijvingGeneriek. Set from the Roles tab in case-type settings, and shipped by the bezwaar and besluitvorming seed data.",
        "The generic role this case-type role plays, so routing rules and reports can speak about \"the handler\" without knowing every case type's own naming. Maps to the ZGW RolType field omschrijvingGeneriek. Set from the Roles tab in case-type settings, and shipped by the bezwaar and besluitvorming seed data. `gemachtigde` is the authorised representative of Awb 2:1: the row carrying it has no caseType, so every case type offers it, and SeedGemachtigdeRoleType keeps exactly one of it.": "The generic role this case-type role plays, so routing rules and reports can speak about \"the handler\" without knowing every case type's own naming. Maps to the ZGW RolType field omschrijvingGeneriek. Set from the Roles tab in case-type settings, and shipped by the bezwaar and besluitvorming seed data. `gemachtigde` is the authorised representative of Awb 2:1: the row carrying it has no caseType, so every case type offers it, and SeedGemachtigdeRoleType keeps exactly one of it.",
