        "The grant scheme applied under: a caseType, since a scheme IS the blueprint its applications are governed by (see openspec/changes/subsidieregeling-is-a-casetype)": "The grant scheme applied under: a caseType, since a scheme IS the blueprint its applications are governed by (see openspec/changes/subsidieregeling-is-a-casetype)",
        "The ground for access: a role assignment, consent, fg-audit-override, openconnector-sharing and so on. For an existence question this ground is chosen BEFORE the answer and not filled in afterwards (D-7), and without a ground no answer is given.": "The ground for access: a role assignment, consent, fg-audit-override, openconnector-sharing and so on. For an existence question this ground is chosen BEFORE the answer and not filled in afterwards (D-7), and without a ground no answer is given.",
