        "The markers the system may raise on a case of this type. Each one is a PAIR: the condition that raises it and the condition that clears it. Written as code the pair ends up in two files and drifts, so it is declared here where an administrator can read it and a test can check it. A declaration carrying a raise condition and no clear condition is refused on publication, naming the marker.": "The markers the system may raise on a case of this type. Each one is a PAIR: the condition that raises it and the condition that clears it. Written as code the pair ends up in two files and drifts, so it is declared here where an administrator can read it and a test can check it. A declaration carrying a raise condition and no clear condition is refused on publication, naming the marker.",
