        "What": "What",
        "What a case type costs, per rule and validity date. The fee schedules are shillinq's.": "What a case type costs, per rule and validity date. The fee schedules are shillinq's.",
        "What a failing sender-authentication verdict means for this kind of case. A melding from an unauthenticated sender is normal. A bezwaar from one is a forgery risk. Quarantine is the default because it neither drops a message nor files a forged one.": "What a failing sender-authentication verdict means for this kind of case. A melding from an unauthenticated sender is normal. A bezwaar from one is a forgery risk. Quarantine is the default because it neither drops a message nor files a forged one.",
        "What a handler picks from the list, in their own words.": "What a handler picks from the list, in their own words.",
        "What a handler reads on the case, for example Send the confirmation or Call after ten days.": "What a handler reads on the case, for example Send the confirmation or Call after ten days.",
        "What a handler should know before taking this step": "What a handler should know before taking this step",
        "What a leaver handover did to this case: who held it before, who holds it now, who ran the act and when. Written once per act, so the work of somebody who has left is traceable a year later.": "What a leaver handover did to this case: who held it before, who holds it now, who ran the act and when. Written once per act, so the work of somebody who has left is traceable a year later.",
        "What a match marks the document as.": "What a match marks the document as.",
        "What a person reads for the field, in their language. Without one the field's name is shown.": "What a person reads for the field, in their language. Without one the field's name is shown.",
        "What a person reads per choice list option, by the option's value (digitaal: Digitaal). An option without one shows its value.": "What a person reads per choice list option, by the option's value (digitaal: Digitaal). An option without one shows its value.",
        "What a resident may be told this team is called, for example Team Vergunningen. Leave it empty and the resident is told no team at all, which is better than a name they cannot place. The team's own name stays internal, because it may name a person or a code.": "What a resident may be told this team is called, for example Team Vergunningen. Leave it empty and the resident is told no team at all, which is better than a name they cannot place. The team's own name stays internal, because it may name a person or a code.",
        "What a split of a case of this type may divide. Which documents belong to which half is a judgement about the content and only the handler has it; what may be divided AT ALL is a rule that does not change per case, so it is declared here once and the handler is offered the allowed choices and no others. ABSENT MEANS ALL THREE: every case type predates this key, and reading silence as \"nothing may be divided\" would ship a split action that refuses every split on the day it arrives.": "What a split of a case of this type may divide. Which documents belong to which half is a judgement about the content and only the handler has it; what may be divided AT ALL is a rule that does not change per case, so it is declared here once and the handler is offered the allowed choices and no others. ABSENT MEANS ALL THREE: every case type predates this key, and reading silence as \"nothing may be divided\" would ship a split action that refuses every split on the day it arrives.",
        "What advice is needed?": "What advice is needed?",
        "What an inspector sees on the phone: the day offline, a checklist with photos and the queue to synchronise": "What an inspector sees on the phone: the day offline, a checklist with photos and the queue to synchronise",
        "What an open obligation of this kind withholds. A statusType uuid per entry, or the token `closing` for every status that closes the case. Leave it empty and it blocks the closing statuses, which is what an obligation is for in almost every case.": "What an open obligation of this kind withholds. A statusType uuid per entry, or the token `closing` for every status that closes the case. Leave it empty and it blocks the closing statuses, which is what an obligation is for in almost every case.",
        "What became of the message. Every processed message has one and there is no seventh value meaning dropped": "What became of the message. Every processed message has one and there is no seventh value meaning dropped",
        "What can be done": "What can be done",
