        "What happens": "What happens",
        "What happens in this step.": "What happens in this step.",
        "What happens next": "What happens next",
        "What happens to the answers on this case": "What happens to the answers on this case",
        "What happens to this case once it is closed": "What happens to this case once it is closed",
        "What happens when a case of this type meets a condition, in order. Each rule has a moment, conditions that must all hold and actions. Published with the version and frozen with it. The Rules tab lists them as 'Als ... / dan ...' rows.": "What happens when a case of this type meets a condition, in order. Each rule has a moment, conditions that must all hold and actions. Published with the version and frozen with it. The Rules tab lists them as 'Als ... / dan ...' rows.",
        "What happens when a new case of this type looks like one that already exists. On warn, the handler sees the matches and decides. On block, only a coordinator may file it anyway, and they have to say why. The matching itself is not set here: the case schema declares the rules and OpenRegister scores them, so the same pair the nightly sweep finds is the pair the form shows.": "What happens when a new case of this type looks like one that already exists. On warn, the handler sees the matches and decides. On block, only a coordinator may file it anyway, and they have to say why. The matching itself is not set here: the case schema declares the rules and OpenRegister scores them, so the same pair the nightly sweep finds is the pair the form shows.",
        "What has happened": "What has happened",
        "What has to be done": "What has to be done",
        "What has to be done. This is the title of the task that is created.": "What has to be done. This is the title of the task that is created.",
        "What is asked for (optional)": "What is asked for (optional)",
        "What is being asked for, in the words the handler reads where the transition would have been. Write it as the thing itself: \"the fire safety inspection\" rather than \"obligation of kind inspection\".": "What is being asked for, in the words the handler reads where the transition would have been. Write it as the thing itself: \"the fire safety inspection\" rather than \"obligation of kind inspection\".",
