        "What shillinq reports about the money on this case, held as a projection so the list can be filtered on it. dossiq stores the word and nothing else: no amount received, no ledger line and no payment date, because those are shillinq's and a second copy of money is a second set of books. `stale` means shillinq could not be asked, which is not the same fact as unpaid and is never read as paid.": "What shillinq reports about the money on this case, held as a projection so the list can be filtered on it. dossiq stores the word and nothing else: no amount received, no ledger line and no payment date, because those are shillinq's and a second copy of money is a second set of books. `stale` means shillinq could not be asked, which is not the same fact as unpaid and is never read as paid.",
