        "What somebody may lodge against a decision of this case type, within how long, and with whom. The decision document prints the clause from this declaration and never from a document template, so two case types sharing one template print different terms and a change in the law is one configuration change. Sending the decision binds a term instance of kind remedy from the same declaration, which is what makes 'is this still open to bezwaar' answerable without arithmetic.": "What somebody may lodge against a decision of this case type, within how long, and with whom. The decision document prints the clause from this declaration and never from a document template, so two case types sharing one template print different terms and a change in the law is one configuration change. Sending the decision binds a term instance of kind remedy from the same declaration, which is what makes 'is this still open to bezwaar' answerable without arithmetic.",
