        "What this obligation withholds while it is open. Each entry is a statusType uuid, or the token `closing` for every status that closes the case. The TOKEN is what makes a case type with three ways out safe: a list of ids has to be kept complete by hand, and the door somebody forgot is the one the case leaves by. An empty list blocks the closing statuses.": "What this obligation withholds while it is open. Each entry is a statusType uuid, or the token `closing` for every status that closes the case. The TOKEN is what makes a case type with three ways out safe: a list of ids has to be kept complete by hand, and the door somebody forgot is the one the case leaves by. An empty list blocks the closing statuses.",
