        "Where the transcription of a voice memo has got to; not_applicable for every other kind of evidence. These are the values TranscriptionService actually writes. The list used to read pending/syncing/synced/failed, which is verbatim the syncQueue status vocabulary: it answers whether a row reached the server, not whether anybody has transcribed the memo.": "Where the transcription of a voice memo has got to; not_applicable for every other kind of evidence. These are the values TranscriptionService actually writes. The list used to read pending/syncing/synced/failed, which is verbatim the syncQueue status vocabulary: it answers whether a row reached the server, not whether anybody has transcribed the memo.",
        "Where this document was found when it was collected onto a case: the source and system, the custodian whose files held it, its location, the search terms, when the search ran and who ran it. Written once, when the document is collected.": "Where this document was found when it was collected onto a case: the source and system, the custodian whose files held it, its location, the search terms, when the search ran and who ran it. Written once, when the document is collected.",
        "Where this incident stands. Deliberately three values and no transition machine: an incident is a report inside a case, and a lifecycle of its own would make it the deelzaak it must not become.": "Where this incident stands. Deliberately three values and no transition machine: an incident is a report inside a case, and a lifecycle of its own would make it the deelzaak it must not become.",
        "Where this obligation stands. Met and withdrawn both release the case and are never recorded as each other: an inspection nobody carried out is not an inspection that passed, and six months later that difference is the whole record.": "Where this obligation stands. Met and withdrawn both release the case and are never recorded as each other: an inspection nobody carried out is not an inspection that passed, and six months later that difference is the whole record.",
