        "Whether a case of this type needs a coordinator named before its besluit is signed. The Awb answer is signed by the second seat, and a case type that leaves this off never asks for one: most cases have a handler and nobody else.": "Whether a case of this type needs a coordinator named before its besluit is signed. The Awb answer is signed by the second seat, and a case type that leaves this off never asks for one: most cases have a handler and nobody else.",
        "Whether a case of this type owes the applicant a penalty when the decision comes late (Wet dwangsom bij niet tijdig beslissen). It runs only after the applicant has given notice of default. Leave it empty when the case type does not say.": "Whether a case of this type owes the applicant a penalty when the decision comes late (Wet dwangsom bij niet tijdig beslissen). It runs only after the applicant has given notice of default. Leave it empty when the case type does not say.",
        "Whether a case of this type waits for its leges before it may be handled. A vergunningaanvraag does; a melding openbare ruimte does not, because a pothole nobody fixed is a worse outcome than a fee nobody collected. Absent means no, so nothing on an existing install starts waiting for money the day this ships. Where it is true and the payment state cannot be read, the act is refused rather than allowed (ADR-102).": "Whether a case of this type waits for its leges before it may be handled. A vergunningaanvraag does; a melding openbare ruimte does not, because a pothole nobody fixed is a worse outcome than a fee nobody collected. Absent means no, so nothing on an existing install starts waiting for money the day this ships. Where it is true and the payment state cannot be read, the act is refused rather than allowed (ADR-102).",
        "Whether a handover of this case is waiting for the receiving team to accept it. A projection of the open casetransfer record and never a second custody trail: it exists so the sending team's list can show what it handed on and nobody picked up.": "Whether a handover of this case is waiting for the receiving team to accept it. A projection of the open casetransfer record and never a second custody trail: it exists so the sending team's list can show what it handed on and nobody picked up.",
