        "Whether the platform reported the file downloadable at the last reading. A convenience for the work list; the case page asks the platform again before it offers the link, because readiness is the platform's fact and this is a copy of it.": "Whether the platform reported the file downloadable at the last reading. A convenience for the work list; the case page asks the platform again before it offers the link, because readiness is the platform's fact and this is a copy of it.",
        "Whether the process owns the status of cases of this type. Where it does, a status only moves through a declared transition and a direct write of the status field is refused. This is a per case type declaration and not a product decision, because a gemeente running both kinds is the normal case.": "Whether the process owns the status of cases of this type. Where it does, a status only moves through a declared transition and a direct write of the status field is refused. This is a per case type declaration and not a product decision, because a gemeente running both kinds is the normal case.",
