        "Whether the work obligation exemption is active.": "Whether the work obligation exemption is active.",
        "Whether the zaaksysteem behind this endpoint may open cases, change cases and add documents in dossiq. Off by default. The messages arrive through the integriq source named above, which authenticates the sender; dossiq carries them out as the background service account.": "Whether the zaaksysteem behind this endpoint may open cases, change cases and add documents in dossiq. Off by default. The messages arrive through the integriq source named above, which authenticates the sender; dossiq carries them out as the background service account.",
        "Whether this advisory body is currently active and available for consultation": "Whether this advisory body is currently active and available for consultation",
        "Whether this case currently carries a raised attention flag. Derived from the flag history and never typed, so the facet and the history cannot disagree. The work list filters on it, which is what makes 'the flagged ones' a view rather than a search through tags.": "Whether this case currently carries a raised attention flag. Derived from the flag history and never typed, so the facet and the history cannot disagree. The work list filters on it, which is what makes 'the flagged ones' a view rather than a search through tags.",
        "Whether this case has been declared major. Declaring it is the act; the working channel is the consequence. Set by MajorCaseDeclaration through a permissioned endpoint, never by hand.": "Whether this case has been declared major. Declaring it is the act; the working channel is the consequence. Set by MajorCaseDeclaration through a permissioned endpoint, never by hand.",
        "Whether this case is still a draft. A draft binds no statutory term, appears in no working list, count or report, and is visible only to its author. Promoting it is one act that binds the term. A concept-zaak whose Awb clock has not started is a real object in a gemeente, and the alternative is a half-filled case that is already overdue.": "Whether this case is still a draft. A draft binds no statutory term, appears in no working list, count or report, and is visible only to its author. Promoting it is one act that binds the term. A concept-zaak whose Awb clock has not started is a real object in a gemeente, and the alternative is a half-filled case that is already overdue.",
        "Whether this case is still its own case. The OpenRegister merge engine writes this field and reads it back, which is why it is a plain value of its own and not the ending act: the engine compares it as a string and refuses a survivor that is not active. An absent value reads as active, so every case written before merging existed stays mergeable.": "Whether this case is still its own case. The OpenRegister merge engine writes this field and reads it back, which is why it is a plain value of its own and not the ending act: the engine compares it as a string and refuses a survivor that is not active. An absent value reads as active, so every case written before merging existed stays mergeable.",
        "Whether this case owes an acknowledgement of receipt at all.": "Whether this case owes an acknowledgement of receipt at all.",
        "Whether this case owes an acknowledgement of receipt, and whether it was met. A failed send is a state here rather than a line in the application log, because somebody has to perform the duty by hand once the retries run out.": "Whether this case owes an acknowledgement of receipt, and whether it was met. A failed send is a state here rather than a line in the application log, because somebody has to perform the duty by hand once the retries run out.",
        "Whether this case type is a draft (not yet published)": "Whether this case type is a draft (not yet published)",
        "Whether this case type is offered as a starting point when somebody creates a new one. A template is an ordinary case type, so it keeps one editor and one permission model.": "Whether this case type is offered as a starting point when somebody creates a new one. A template is an ordinary case type, so it keeps one editor and one permission model.",
        "Whether this case type was last retired or restored. Two fields beside it name who did it and when. They sit on the case type because dossiq has no general record of administrative acts yet: statusRecord is shaped for a status transition and carries no actor at all. They move into that record when lifecycle-acts-on-the-case lands.": "Whether this case type was last retired or restored. Two fields beside it name who did it and when. They sit on the case type because dossiq has no general record of administrative acts yet: statusRecord is shaped for a status transition and carries no actor at all. They move into that record when lifecycle-acts-on-the-case lands.",
