        "Whether this case was routed by the case type's fallback because its address fell in no administered boundary. Addresses do: new developments, water, an address abroad, a case with no address at all. The flag is what keeps that from looking like routing that silently did nothing.": "Whether this case was routed by the case type's fallback because its address fell in no administered boundary. Addresses do: new developments, water, an address abroad, a case with no address at all. The flag is what keeps that from looking like routing that silently did nothing.",
