        "Whether this handover is a doorzending under Awb 2:3, which obliges us to tell the applicant where the case went. An internal move between two teams of the same bestuursorgaan is not a doorzending and tells the applicant nothing.": "Whether this handover is a doorzending under Awb 2:3, which obliges us to tell the applicant where the case went. An internal move between two teams of the same bestuursorgaan is not a doorzending and tells the applicant nothing.",
