        "Who is pulled into the working channel when a case of this type is declared major. A user id, or a group as group:<gid>, or a bare group id. A name that does not resolve refuses the declaration rather than opening a channel that is missing the one person who had to be in it (ADR-102). A type that names nobody cannot be declared major. NOT visible:false: this is the field an administrator fills in on the case type, and visible:false hides a property on every surface, including the editor.": "Who is pulled into the working channel when a case of this type is declared major. A user id, or a group as group:<gid>, or a bare group id. A name that does not resolve refuses the declaration rather than opening a channel that is missing the one person who had to be in it (ADR-102). A type that names nobody cannot be declared major. NOT visible:false: this is the field an administrator fills in on the case type, and visible:false hides a property on every surface, including the editor.",
        "Who is the initiator?": "Who is the initiator?",
